ISO-10303-21;
/* Twi234: Single ADVANCED_FACE on PLANE in CLOSED_SHELL; 4-edge EDGE_LOOP; vertex V0 is at exactly (0,0,0) — the geometric origin IS the defect; E0 is a micro-edge of length ~1e-6 from (0,0,0) to (1e-6,0,0) — sub-tolerance degenerate edge incident to origin vertex; FixDegenerated absolute-comparison vertex-distance test fails at origin (0,0,0) — fails to detect the degenerate edge IS the mechanism; EDGE_LOOP IS wired into FACE_OUTER_BOUND -> ADVANCED_FACE in CLOSED_SHELL — never orphaned */
